-- New stories: 3 Norway stories covering the March 2026 acceleration
-- of the B2B mandate to January 2027, the June 2026 formal legal
-- enactment (Law-2026-06-19-39), and the ongoing exploration of
-- expansion beyond B2B (e-receipts, B2C, software regulation).
