<p><strong>What this means for your team:</strong> none of these three potential expansions are confirmed yet, so there''s no immediate action required based on this investigation alone. But if your business has significant B2C sales volume, or you''re an accounting software provider serving the Norwegian market, this December 2026 report is worth watching directly rather than assuming the current B2B-only scope is where things will settle.</p>');
